     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi users, <div><br></div><div>I am a beginner in qqplot, but I have spent some time to figure out how to make the following thing and didn&#39;t find a solution.  Can you advise the best way to mine problem? I need to make the pretty easy plot and I have no problem with dataplot. But how to make fields as it is shown in the figure below (here shown coordinates of elements for necessary field parts)? Also would be great to got field names, as in the second figure. Thanks!</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-HvGE6ay8SUw/Wl2ZOWaR1OI/AAAAAAAAB1E/gNzZbDhvMs8mlG-vOY1sUOINuiK5-uzfACLcBGAs/s1600/Capture.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-HvGE6ay8SUw/Wl2ZOWaR1OI/AAAAAAAAB1E/gNzZbDhvMs8mlG-vOY1sUOINuiK5-uzfACLcBGAs/s1600/Capture.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366750329000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2yg60-MwWltQzsOzkdwUMQ\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-HvGE6ay8SUw/Wl2ZOWaR1OI/AAAAAAAAB1E/gNzZbDhvMs8mlG-vOY1sUOINuiK5-uzfACLcBGAs/s320/Capture.PNG\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"277\"></a><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-KNMWVxoyy8Q/Wl2ppAvU9DI/AAAAAAAAB1U/WyPFThdU6RYm0OH6PDstcoZRMunHJ4bFwCLcBGAs/s1600/TAS%2Bclassification.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-KNMWVxoyy8Q/Wl2ppAvU9DI/AAAAAAAAB1U/WyPFThdU6RYm0OH6PDstcoZRMunHJ4bFwCLcBGAs/s1600/TAS%252Bclassification.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366750329000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03JqCpg17jIxZfbDkq8Aoq\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-KNMWVxoyy8Q/Wl2ppAvU9DI/AAAAAAAAB1U/WyPFThdU6RYm0OH6PDstcoZRMunHJ4bFwCLcBGAs/s320/TAS%2Bclassification.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"240\"></a></p><div><br></div></div>"
